OL,3,AArrest made over the death of black
OL,4,Awoman found hanged from tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details
OL,9,FPolice in the US state of Mississippi
OL,10,Fhave made their first arrest in the
OL,11,Fcase of a black woman found dead and
OL,12,Fhanged from a tree, and say they could
OL,13,Fsoon take more people into custody.
OL,15,FTasia Fortune's body was found in the
OL,16,Flot of an abandoned home in Jackson in
OL,17,FAugust, but police only announced they
OL,18,Fwere treating her death as a possible
OL,19,Fhomicide earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
