OL,5,
OL,6,F"That arrest today is an important
OL,7,Fdevelopment in this investigation, but
OL,8,Fit is not the conclusion," Jackson
OL,9,FPolice Chief RaShall Brackney said on
OL,10,FFriday. "This case remains active."
